    {
      "id": "1.38.8",
      "label": "1.38.8",
      "numbers": [
        8
      ],
      "devanagari": "एका जनयिता तात पुत्रं वंशकरं तव |\nषष्टिं पुत्रसहस्राणि ह्यपरा जनयिष्यति",
      "iast": "ekā janayitā tāta putram vaṃśakaram tava |\nṣaṣṭim putra sahasrāṇi aparā janayiṣyati",
      "translation": "\" 'One of your wives will mother a son who enriches your dynasty, oh, dear sire, and the other mothers sixty thousand sons.' Said Sage Bhrigu to Sagara.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
