          "iast": "keśinī vamśa karam putram",
          "devanagari": "केशिनी वम्श करं पुत्रं",
          "meaning": "queen Keshini, dynasty, enriching, son",
          "anvayaIndex": 3,
          "verseIndex": 4
        },
        {
