          "iast": "nṛpa sannidhau jagrāha",
          "devanagari": "नृप सन्निधौ जग्राह",
          "meaning": "king [Sagara,] in the presence of, taken - chosen.",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.38.14",
      "label": "1.38.14",
      "numbers": [
        14
      ],
      "devanagari": "षष्टिं पुत्रसहस्राणि सुपर्णभगिनी तदा |\nमहोत्साहान् कीर्तिमतो जग्राह सुमतिः सुतान्",
      "iast": "ṣaṣṭim putra sahasrāṇi suparṇa bhaginī tadā |\nmahotsāhān kīrtimato jagrāha sumatiḥ sutān",
      "translation": "\"Sumati, the sister of mighty-winged Garuda and the second queen of Ssagara has then chosen sixty thousand sons with great enthusiasm and high reputation.",
      "notes": [],
