    {
      "id": "1.38.16",
      "label": "1.38.16",
      "numbers": [
        16
      ],
      "devanagari": "अथ काले गते तस्मिन् ज्येष्ठा पुत्रं व्यजायत |\nअसमंज इति ख्यातं केशिनी सगरात्मजम्",
      "iast": "atha kāle gate tasmin jyeṣṭhā putram vyajāyata |\nasamañja iti khyātam keśinī sagarātmajam",
      "translation": "\"When the time rolled by then the elder wife Keshini gave birth to the son of Sagara who is reputed by the name Asamanja.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "atha",
          "iast": "atha",
          "devanagari": "अथ",
          "meaning": "then",
