    {
      "id": "1.38.18",
      "label": "1.38.18",
      "numbers": [
        18
      ],
      "devanagari": "घृतपूर्णेषु कुंभेषु धात्र्यस्तान् समवर्धयन् |\nकालेन महता सर्वे यौवनं प्रतिपेदिरे",
      "iast": "ghṛta pūrṇeṣu kumbheṣu dhātryaḥ tān samavardhayan |\nkālena mahatā sarve yauvanam pratipedire",
      "translation": "\"The childminders brought up those siblings in vessels filled with ghee, the clarified butter, and after a protracted time all of the children have attained youthfulness.",
