          "anvayaIndex": 6,
          "verseIndex": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.38.19",
      "label": "1.38.19",
      "numbers": [
        19
      ],
      "devanagari": "अथ दीर्घेण कालेन रूपयौवनशालिनः |\nषष्टिः पुत्रसहस्राणि सगरस्याभवंस्तदा",
      "iast": "atha dīrgheṇa kālena rūpa yauvanaśālinaḥ |\nṣaṣṭiḥ putra sahasrāṇi sagarasya abhavan tadā",
      "translation": "\"After a long time the sixty thousand sons of king Sagara have become youthful, and handsome in their aspects.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
